<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span class="ui-provider"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear Valued Blood Program Leader,<br></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>On behalf of the American Red Cross, we extend our heartfelt
gratitude to you for your partnership. By hosting a blood drive, you’ve made a
difference in the lives of patients with sickle cell disease, moms with complicated
childbirths, people fighting cancer, accident or trauma victims, and more.<br></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Your role as a Blood Program Leader reflects a commitment to
